text-gray-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">From the ceremonial drums of the Ngondo festival to the intricate harmonies of the bottle dance, dive deep into the musical heritage that has shaped generations. Our archive features rare recordings, exclusive performances, and in-depth documentaries.</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 font-bold">01</div><div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold">Rare Archives</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Digitally restored recordings from the 70s.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 font-bold">02</div><div><h4 class="text-white font-semibold">Live Performances</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Watch full-length traditional concerts.</p></div></div></div><button class="mt-8 px-6 py-3 border border-red-600 text-red-500 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-red-600 hover:text-white transition-colors" tabindex="0">Explore Collection</button></div><div class="relative h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)"><img alt="Traditional Drummer" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1516026672322-bc52d61a55d5%3Fw%3D800%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1516026672322-bc52d61a55d5%3Fw%3D800%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1516026672322-bc52d61a55d5%3Fw%3D800%26auto%3Dformat%26fit%3Dcrop&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1516026672322-bc52d61a55d5%