" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coffee w-8 h-8 text-blue-500 mb-4"><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M14 2v2"></path><path d="M16 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a4 4 0 1 1 0 8h-1"></path><path d="M6 2v2"></path></svg><div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-600">10+</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Workshops Held</div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target w-8 h-8 text-blue-500 mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-600">0+</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Tech Partners</div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-primary-100">Our Story</h2><p class="text-lg mb-6 text-gray-600">IWS (Innovate with Seed) was born from a vision to transform tech education in Africa. We believe in learning by doing, and our approach combines theoretical knowledge with practical application.</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code w-6 h-6 text-blue-500"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1 text-gray-900">Innovation First</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We embrace cutting-edge technologies and methodologies to stay ahead and solve tomorrow&#x27;s challenges with creative thinking.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6 text-green-500"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1 text-gray-900">Community Driven</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Our supportive ecosystem connects learners and mentors, fostering collaboration, diverse perspectives, and valuable networking opportunities.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book w-6 h-6 text-purple-500"><path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H19a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v18a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H20"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1 text-gray-900">Practical Learning</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We emphasize hands-on experience through real-world projects, bridging theory and practice to build genuine professional skills.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden"><img alt="Our Story" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FfkM0h0c%2FGgl-UTBn-X0-AAo44k.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-primary-100">Our Journey</h2><div class="space-y-12"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 "><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img alt="May -The Beginning" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FLt8pv0d%2Ft1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center"><div><div class="text-blue-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">2024</div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">May -The Beginning</h3><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">SEED- started by planting or giving birth to their own developers, in what we called 5O DAYS Bootcamp</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img alt="October &amp; The Movement" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2F2Phs6kw%2Finternship.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center"><div><div class="text-blue-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">2024</div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">October &amp; The Movement</h3><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">We launch our first internship in October</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 "><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img alt="Of course the future is Ai let us launch - Ai Friday" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2Fh2qbT1B%2Faf2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center"><div><div class="text-blue-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">2024 - November</div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Of course the future is Ai let us launch - Ai Friday</h3><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Meet once every two weeks on Friday&#x27;s, to discuss everything Ai</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative h-[300px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img alt="&lt;WOC/&gt;" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FX5ZPNkg%2FWhats-App-Image-2025-01-08-at-06-01-18.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center"><div><div class="text-blue-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">2024 - December</div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">&lt;WOC/&gt;</h3><p class="text-lg text-gray-600">With dreams of building a sustainable tech community, we launch Weekend Of Code</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="rounded-2xl p-12 text-center bg-blue-600"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2><p class="text-xl text-white/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Join our community of innovators and start building your future in tech today.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white text-blue-600 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity" href="/construction">Explore Programs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-transparent border-2 border-white text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors" href="/contact">Contact Us<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div><footer class="w-full border-t-2 border-blue-500 px-3 bg-light-200"><div class="w-[90%] mx-auto py-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="text-primary-100 h-10 w-10 border border-primary-100 p-2 rounded" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7